Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:24.74,Screen_Place,,0,0,0,,{\blur15}白銀之劍 宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:42.02,Screen_Place,,0,0,0,,{\blur15}百年祭 10天前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:49.64,Screen_Skill,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}治癒光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:22.99,Screen_Place,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\blur15}百年祭 6天前
